Four templates (names are placeholders; see Docs.md on renaming). Put the styles in <code>Template:Timeline/styles.css</code>, copied from <code>prototype/timeline.css</code>.
Needs <code>#if</code> (ParserFunctions). Do not leave blank lines between items or events: wikitext turns them into stray paragraphs inside the list.

== Simple: one event per dot ==
<pre>
{{Timeline
|{{Timeline item |date=1612 |title=The Go academy |text=The Tokugawa shogunate patronises the game.}}
{{Timeline item |date=c. 1651 |title=Huang Longshi |text=Born. |image=Huang Longshi.jpg |caption=Huang Longshi}}
{{Timeline item |date=March 2016 |title=AlphaGo defeats Lee Sedol}}
}}
</pre>

== Several events on one dot ==
<pre>
{{Timeline
|{{Timeline item |date=2006 |events=
{{Timeline event |title=Crazy Stone |text=Monte Carlo tree search arrives in Go.}}
{{Timeline event |title=UCT |text=The UCT algorithm is published.}}
}}
}}
</pre>

== Parallel timelines ==
Give the container <code>track1</code>, <code>track2</code> ... (up to four). Each item then takes <code>tracks</code>, with one <code>Timeline track</code> per track, in the same order. A track with no content leaves a gap. Use the same labels as in the container.
<pre>
{{Timeline |track1=Players |track2=Programs
|{{Timeline item |date=1846 |tracks=
{{Timeline track |label=Players |{{Timeline event |title=The Ear-Reddening Game}}}}
{{Timeline track |label=Programs}}
}}
{{Timeline item |date=March 2016 |tracks=
{{Timeline track |label=Players |{{Timeline event |title=Lee Sedol wins game 4}}}}
{{Timeline track |label=Programs |{{Timeline event |title=AlphaGo wins the match}}}}
}}
}}
</pre>

== Parameters ==
; Timeline: <code>1</code> items; <code>track1</code>–<code>track4</code> labels (optional, enables parallel mode).
; Timeline item: <code>date</code>; either <code>title</code>, <code>text</code>, <code>image</code>, <code>imagesize</code>, <code>imagealt</code>, <code>caption</code> (one event); or <code>events</code> (several <code>Timeline event</code>); or <code>tracks</code> (parallel mode).
; Timeline event: same fields as the one-event shorthand.
; Timeline track: <code>label</code>; <code>1</code> events.
